From: UN1CA <unica@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in in-app Portrait pair diagnostic

Run only after an explicit diagnostic extra or a consumed app-private
cache marker. Test logical20 physical54+52 or opt-in52+56 for up to32
seconds in Camera. Controlled profile tests per-physical AF and timing.
Bounded grayscale/complete YUV samples require explicit profile opt-in.
Preserve onResume registers and normal control flow. Helper classes
use a separate classes5.dex. No native/feature/permission changes.

--- a/smali_classes2/com/sec/android/app/camera/setting/CameraSettingActivity.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/sec/android/app/camera/setting/CameraSettingActivity.smali
